.SS "void csmp::IsoparametricQuadraticTetrahedron::dNr (double r, double s, double t, std::vector< double > & dNr) const\fR [virtual]\fP"
This method and the complementary method \fBdNs()\fP compute the shape function derivates with respect to the local coordinate axis\&.
.SH "Input Arguments"
.PP
The method takes the local coordinates of the point at which the shape function derivatives shall be evaluated as third argument\&.

.PP
\fBParameters\fP
.RS 4
\fIDNR\fP The shape function derivatives are returned into the second method argument which is a Meschpp floating point vector of the size n=nodes per element\&.
.RE
.PP
